@startuml 图2-35 序列图：出行数据采集（模拟）（UC-03 用例实现）
' 依据：需求规格说明书用例清单；代码 apps/api/internal/httpserver 与 repo（2026-11-26）
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor "市民" as U
participant "前端\n(TripCapturePage)" as FE
participant "Router + 中间件\n(auth / timeout)" as API
participant "TripHandler\n(httpserver/trips.go)" as H
participant "domain\n(carbon / points)" as D
database "MySQL\n(travel_mode / trip / carbon / point / outbox)" as DB

U -> FE : 选择方式、手工输入距离与起止时间
FE -> API : POST /api/v1/trips
API -> API : Bearer 验签 / 开发头回退
API -> H : ReportTrip(userID, cmd)
H -> DB : SELECT ef_base, ef_actual\nFROM travel_mode WHERE code = ?
DB --> H : factors
H -> D : CheckRule(distance, rule)
alt 距离越界 / 方式停用
  H --> API : 400 E_DISTANCE_OUT_OF_RANGE
  API --> FE : {code: E_DISTANCE_OUT_OF_RANGE}
  FE --> U : 提示允许区间 [0.1, 100] km
else 采集数据合法
  H -> H : tripHash = hashTrip(userID, mode, distance, startedAt)
  H -> DB : BEGIN
  H -> DB : SELECT ... FROM trip_record\nWHERE user_id=? AND trip_hash=?
  alt 幂等命中
    H -> DB : COMMIT
    H --> API : 200 首次结果 + deduplicated=true
    API --> FE : 响应壳
    FE --> U : 提示“该行程已申报，未重复发分”
  else 首次采集
    H -> DB : INSERT trip_record\n(mode_code, distance_km,\n started_at, ended_at, trip_hash)
    H -> D : EvaluateTrip(distance, factors, rule, alreadyToday)
    D --> H : carbonSavedG / raw / granted / capped
    H -> DB : INSERT carbon_record\n(trip_id, ef_base, ef_actual,\n carbon_saved_g, rule_snapshot)
    H -> DB : INSERT IGNORE point_account(user_id)
    H -> DB : SELECT id, balance FROM point_account\nWHERE user_id=? FOR UPDATE
    opt granted > 0
      H -> DB : INSERT point_txn(TRAVEL, +granted)
      H -> DB : GrantPointsWithBatch(...)
    end
    H -> DB : UPDATE point_account\n(balance, total_saved_g, version)
    H -> DB : INSERT event_outbox(TripVerified)
    H -> DB : COMMIT
    H --> API : 201 {tripId, carbonSavedG, points}
    API --> FE : 响应壳
    FE --> U : 展示本次减排与积分
  end
end

note over H
  **当前是“模拟采集”**：没有 GPS / 设备 / 第三方运动接口，
  由用户在表单手工填写；trip_hash 幂等与真实采集共用同一条上报路径。
end note
note over H, DB
  现实情况：TripHandler 直接持有 *sql.DB 并在 handler 内写 SQL（设计偏差 D-01），
  目标态应下沉到 repo/trips.go 或 usecase；本图按实际调用顺序绘制。
end note

@enduml
